# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# Spanish, French and Brazilian Portuguese are frozen (docs/i18n/FROZEN.md): their old URLs go to
# the English page. Keep in step with `redirects` in astro.config.mjs.
/es /en 301
/es/* /en 301
/fr /en 301
/fr/* /en 301
/pt-br /en 301
/pt-br/* /en 301
